    answer: "Any response from a prospect to a cold email or LinkedIn message they never asked for. It can be interested, a brush-off or a question, such as \"send me more info\" or \"not right now.\" Across Myntmore-managed campaigns, 1% to 3% of prospects reply, and at least 20% of those replies are positive."
  - question: "How fast should I respond to a cold email reply?"
